ills plus macos-visual-baseline; version-policy in the tanstack\naudit/remediate/migrate skills with the corrected baseline-reference count),\nadd the waiver-policy paragraph to tailrocks-document, change \"generated\" to\n\"vendored\" in the two surviving repository-audit-lanes copies, and regenerate\ngenerated docs where skill-local files were removed.\n\nSigned-off-by: Alexey Zhokhov <alexey@zhokhov.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","verified_at":"2026-09-08T13:43:11Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-rust-skills/commits/bcc31b1d935dac4de191a6b71b3091f628d204c0","html_url":"https://github.com/tailrocks/tailrocks-rust-skills/commit/bcc31b1d935dac4de191a6b71b3091f628d204c0","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tailrocks/tailrocks-rust-skills/commits/bcc31b1d935dac4de191a6b71b3091f628d204c0/comments","author":{"login":"donbeave","id":139017,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTAxNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139017?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave","html_url":"https://github.com/donbeave","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/donbeave/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.c